    <node id="Формула (LaTeX)">
      <data key="d0">Формула (LaTeX)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Формула (LaTeX) is the title or name of a mathematical equation.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical formula represented in LaTeX format.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical formula in LaTeX format.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical formula represented in LaTeX notation.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-aeab57fd22d9f58874a6b009381a44e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e104e211de2f2d77ed73269623c39fd2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c56198a0794567b8a66b9441de3390aa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d819daef2870109e4e331743885c4fcd-chunk-000</data>
