      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="b">
      <data key="d0">b</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">b is an unknown coefficient in the quadratic equation.&lt;SEP&gt;b is one of the coefficients in a quadratic equation, used for calculating the discriminant.&lt;SEP&gt;The variable b is one of the coefficients in the quadratic equation.&lt;SEP&gt;The variable 'b' represents a numerical value in the equation.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-aeab57fd22d9f58874a6b009381a44e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93b6acd960d94a31188c3d66a7ec9b38-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e104e211de2f2d77ed73269623c39fd2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c56198a0794567b8a66b9441de3390aa-chunk-000</data>
