      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="c">
      <data key="d0">c</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">c is another unknown coefficient in the quadratic equation.&lt;SEP&gt;c is yet another coefficient in a quadratic equation, used alongside b and a to calculate the discriminant.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-aeab57fd22d9f58874a6b009381a44e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93b6acd960d94a31188c3d66a7ec9b38-chunk-000</data>
