      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">a is another coefficient in a quadratic equation, used alongside b and c to calculate the discriminant.&lt;SEP&gt;The variable a is another coefficient in the quadratic equation and part of the denominator.&lt;SEP&gt;The variable 'a' represents a value that equals 1 according to the assertion.</data>
